id=MTK_D8100_Vulkan1.4.Panvk
name=Dimensity 8100 PanVK WSI7 (Vulkan only)
version=1.1.2
versionCode=14
author=wxcvm; upstream zenithblue-oss
description=PanVK WSI7 1.1.2 FINAL (performance-clean, zygote namespace fix) for PGKM10/Android 17. Same driver as 1.1.1 (GPU-uncached imports for the SystemUI shareability fault, one-shot Android acquire replay for WeChat, AFBC YU10 Vulkan import) with two packaging fixes: service.sh.orig is shipped again, and scope=system now injects the ICD into the zygote app-spawn namespaces after boot_completed because this device's zygote64 rebuilds its mount namespace during boot. HWUI Vulkan stays disabled because ColorOS/Skia aborts on vendor 10-bit AHB. See docs/RELEASE-1.1.2.md and docs/FINAL-REPORT.md.
